      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Per-device GPU metrics come from the **DCGM exporter** (`DCGM_FI_DEV_*`). These panels are empty until a `dcgm-exporter` scrape target is live (see `prometheus.yml` job `dcgm-exporter`). Per-node identity stays on the exporter's `Hostname`/`gpu` labels — never in an app metric."
      }
